                    "He retreated to the cave of Hira, where Jibril came and commanded 'Read!' — 'I cannot read' — thrice, then the first Qur'anic verses descended: 'Read in the name of your Lord who created' (96:1). He returned trembling to Khadijah, who reassured him: Allah will never disgrace you — you keep ties, speak truth, and bear others' burdens. Her cousin Waraqah, a Christian scholar, recognized the divine law that came upon Moses and foretold his people's expulsion of him.",
